---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Altair Rostam, technical focus, working style, and interests.">
  <section class="content-shell grid gap-12 pt-14 pb-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_220px] lg:items-start">
    <div>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold">Altair Rostam</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-prose text-secondary">
        I build AI systems with an eye for retrieval quality, automation boundaries, evaluation loops, and the operational details that decide whether a prototype becomes useful.
      </p>
      <section class="mt-10 max-w-prose">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-base font-semibold">How I work</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-secondary">
          I like systems that are explicit about their assumptions. The work usually starts with a sharp problem statement, then moves through small experiments, documented tradeoffs, and a bias toward artifacts future-me can actually understand.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <figure class="flex w-full flex-col items-center lg:mt-16 lg:max-w-[200px]">
      <img
        src="/images/mbti-clear.png"
        alt="Illustrated personality sketch of Altair"
        width="200"
        height="200"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption class="metadata mt-3 text-center">Personality sketch / thinking style artifact</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
